        {
          "key": "B",
          "text": "「上次是谁半夜十一点还在改你们的需求？您要不要现在把这句话说完整？」",
          "effects": {
            "tki_competing": 1.8,
            "pac_parent": 1.2,
            "big5_assert": 1.4,
            "def_attack": 1.0
          },
          "social_desirability": 0
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "text": "「嗯，我们这边确实也有做得不够的地方，我回去再核一下。」然后没再抬头。",
          "effects": {
            "tki_accommodating": 1.7,
            "pac_child": 1.4,
            "tki_avoiding": 1.2,
            "big5_compliance": 1.0
          },
          "social_desirability": 1
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "text": "没接话，把本子合上；会后写了一份三页的时间线，抄送给了在场的所有人。",
          "effects": {
            "tki_avoiding": 1.6,
            "covert_control": 1.6,
            "def_intellectual": 1.2,
            "pac_parent": -1.0
          },
          "social_desirability": 2
        }
      ]
